    "text": "<p>Osmotic pressure <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math></p><p><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo></math>Van&#39;t&nbsp;hoff factor</p><p>According to question,</p><p>for XY&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mi>XY</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mi>BaCl</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.06</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math></p>",
